+ | `MESSAGE` | Text | Yes | No | - | pmd.import_error.message | Human-readable explanation of the problem. |
+ | `CREATED_AT` | Timestamp UTC (yyyy-mm-dd hh:mm:ss) | No | No | - | pmd.import_error.created_at | When it was 
logged (UTC). |
